  m_text: 'LIFT NET SANDBOX


    Click the dock to build a free practice net.

    Click
    the net to collect fish.

    Use the hammer to repair it.


    Collect fish
    once and repair to full durability.


    The practice net catches fish and loses
    durability faster than a normal net.


    At zero durability, it stops catching
    fish but does not disappear. Repair it to resume.


    No materials are consumed.

    No
    fish are added to your inventory.'
